# Claude Code working directories.
# `worktrees/` holds real git worktrees for agent runs — 2.3GB here, and it is
# regenerated state, never source. `skills/` is vendored tooling rather than
# this app's code. `settings.json` is ignored too: plugin installers write
# absolute machine-local paths into it (graphify's PreToolUse hooks point at
# /Users/<name>/.local/bin/graphify), so it is per-machine, not shared config.
.claude/

# graphify knowledge graph. Derived from the source on demand — `graphify
# update .` rebuilds the AST layer for free, and the semantic layer is cached
# under graphify-out/cache/. Never source.
graphify-out/

# Impeccable design workflow.
# `design.json` IS tracked — it is the DESIGN.md sidecar and a real project
# artifact. Everything else here is machine-local: a hook cache, local config
# overrides, and the live-mode session journal.
.impeccable/config.local.json
.impeccable/hook.cache.json
.impeccable/live/
